					"content": "也許是灰灰。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 718030504,
					"content": "稍等，我把那份委託拿出來，對比一下特徵。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 718030505,
					"content": "我看看…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 718030506,
					"content": "大部分都符合…看來牠確實是那份委託要找的貓。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 718030508,
					"content": "委託人會很高興的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030509
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 718030509,
					"content": "呼…兜兜轉轉一大圈，居然又轉回了找貓這種委託。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 718030510,
					"content": "真是讓人不知道說什麼好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 718030511,
					"content": "#我會把這兩份委託分別向委託人報告，辛苦{F#妳}{M#你}了，這是報酬，請收下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 718030512,
					"content": "但那份找貓的委託…委託人似乎已經搬家了，聯繫到他們也許還需要一點時間。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 718030513,
					"content": "在委託人過來之前，這個小傢伙，就由我先照顧著吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718030514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嵐姐"
				},
				{
					"id": 718030514,
					"content": "喵喵，喵！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
